FIRESTORM.

1ST TROOP OF THE 33RD HAS RECEIVED ORDERS FROM REGIMENTAL 
COMMAND TO ASSUME A COURSE HEADING OF 117ø SOUTH AND EAST. 
THIS MISSION IS A MOP-UP OPERATION AGAINST REMNANT NATO 
OCCUPATIONAL FORCES. MISSION OBJECTIVES ARE TO INCLUDE 
REMAINING SIGNALS INTELLIGENCE/ELECTRONIC WARFARE PLATFORMS. 

YOUR SECONDARY TARGET IS THE REMAINING REBEL FIELD COMMAND 
BASE. BE ADVISED THAT REMAINING NATO UNITS HAVE ASSUMED A 
DUG IN POSTURE AND ALL FORWARD APPROACH ZONES HAVE BEEN 
HEAVILY SATURATED WITH MINEFIELDS. 

2ND TROOP HAS RECEIVED ORDERS TO PROCEED NORTH AND EAST ON A 
COURSE HEADING OF 057ø NORTH BY NORTH-EAST. THIS WILL BRING 2ND 
TROOP INTO CONTACT WITH ENEMY FIELD ARTILLERY BATTERIES AND 
SIGNALS INTELLIGENCE UPLINK EMPLACEMENTS. THE EMPLACEMENT WILL BE 
2ND TROOP'S PRIMARY OBJECTIVE. 

YOUR FINAL MISSION OBJECTIVE IS TO RIDE IN SUPPORT OF 1ST 
TROOP'S OPERATION AGAINST REMAINING NATO UNIT FIELD COMMAND.
